You can do uniform(0,10) on sigma but gneerally I'd prefer something smoother that drops off gradually, something like a half-cauchy.
Also, I can't see it making sense to do things in Jags. If Stan is running much slower (in time per effective sample size) that Jags, this is a problem we should be able to fix.
A

