Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Crashing STAN violating assert() in eigen
Message-ID: <sG78L40Me24.P1DD8Trg0CgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <sG78L40Me24.a7HVHNT12XMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <sG78L40Me24.YINX8uI9Je4J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <sG78L40Me24.a7HVHNT12XMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
